  "description": "Just Enough Education to Perform is the third studio album by Welsh rock band Stereophonics. Released on 11 April 2001, the album topped the UK Albums Chart with 140,000 copies sold, and spawned three top-twenty singles in the form of \"Mr. Writer\", \"Have a Nice Day\" and \"Step on My Old Size Nines\". The album's title comes from a line in the song \"Mr. Writer\".",
